  "description": "Dan-Ho, who needed money due to his ex-boyfriend's threats, inadvertently participates in a cosplay competition that he told her about. The host of the competition, streamer Magikun, senses Dan-Ho's talent for broadcasting the moment he sees him and offers him as a guest on his channel. Dan-Ho is tempted by the 5 million won per appearance fee, but...? When he visits Magikun's house for rehearsal, all he finds are adult products, restraints, and cosplay costumes!\n\n *\"Was this by any chance an adult broadcast?!\"*\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
